    "head_commit_message": "feat(native): rout_bench and native_bench timed in the crate (spec 39 step 8c-xix)\n\nbreach_rout_bench sets up rout_bench.gd's battle in the crate (many friendly\nformations along one lane, the front half routing back through the rear) and\ntimes the rout's pass alone, as FormationRout.step runs it. breach_native_bench\nbrings FormationBench's clash to its fight and times the crate's tick on one\nthread and on the pool, with the bodies' parting and the seek inside it; the\nGodot boundary's sync, call and write columns have no crate counterpart. Cargo\ntests hold both battles to Godot's events and digest state.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011AyPi2ApkbYs1VEQnhzjWF",
